                                                "sense_id": "f36925fd-97aa-36f0-844c-9806ed59440a",
                                                "text": "September 10, 1828, Nathaniel William Taylor, Sermon delivered in the Chapel of Yale College\nThat sin or guilt pertains exclusively to voluntary action is the true principle of orthodoxy."
                                            },
